    {
      "id": "7f57f6bf51c87acee8433dabc7e80f2361e0ca47",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2828942646,
          "type": null,
          "body": "A huge amount of headers were added to the public headers in 21d2158a0bf39c08af6c5a24ef9895f819cd3af3 and I don't believe that benefits actual plugin developers.\nThe original review is not available anymore, but it may be worth revisiting what headers we ship and what's actually needed for plugin development.",
          "author": {
            "id": 7384671,
            "username": "rbalint",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Balint Reczey",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3dff6a01e100a1b24a9d11cb0328f45b04c323c72058516e1e855106a993206b?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/rbalint"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:23:00.651Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-10-17T15:23:00.651Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 424620372,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 21904,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1058dae5412697cd928ee96c66e22b70b5e01e74",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2829154678,
          "type": null,
          "body": "While I agree there are too many public headers, it really does depend on the plugin you are trying to develop.  Variants or offshoots of niche protocols should still be able to use the functionality of the \"base\" niche protocol (whether that's a helper function or an enumeration for a dissector table) for a plugin and that's what makes your request difficult.",
          "author": {
            "id": 8399509,
            "username": "mmann78",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Michael Mann",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/fad119898ba16a3f8be2f765dcff399098444abd4f85a04d4c3ef415a2bbe3d9?s=80&d=identicon",
